## Why This Is Asked
Tests DP over subsequences with a practical text-processing flavor and shows how to structure state for two-character alternation.

## Key Concepts
- DP over character pairs
- Two-state subsequence extension
- Reconstruction from DP

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode for one pair (a,b)
